ate before their sources can be synced. If the client has not yet been approved, see <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/9000275131-mtd-it-client-approval\">MTD IT: Client Approval</a>.<br></span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9251237951/original/pFsI7ubBsIhZyqxChywWftXE84jdlksQcQ.gif?1783679568\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9251237951\"></span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:34;892-925\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>How to sync sources from HMRC</strong></span></span></p><ol class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" data-sourcepos=\"19:1-22:33;927-1058\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:32;927-958\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Navigation &gt; MTD IT &gt; Manage</span></span></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"20:1-20:35;959-993\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Click into the relevant client.</span></span></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:32;994-1025\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Navigate to the Sources tab.</span></span></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:33;1026-1058\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Click Sync Sources from HMRC.<br><br></span></span></li></ol><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"24:1-24:183;1060-1242\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This will re-sync the client's income sources with HMRC, pulling through any sources currently held on HMRC's systems (for example self-employment, UK property, or foreign property).<br><br></span></span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"26:1-26:46;1244-1289\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>If a source does not appear after syncing</strong></span></span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"28:1-28:193;1291-1483\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Capium can only display sources that HMRC has recorded against the client. If an expected source is still missing after syncing, the source has not yet been added on HMRC's side. In this case:</span></span></p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" data-sourcepos=\"30:1-31:100;1485-1689\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"30:1-30:105;1485-1589\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The client or agent should contact HMRC directly to confirm the source has been added to their record.</span></span></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"31:1-31:100;1590-1689\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Once HMRC has added the source, return to the Sources tab and click Sync Sources from HMRC again.<br><br></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"33:1-33:236;1691-1926\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">For more on how sources are first set up with HMRC, see <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/9000274663-mtd-it-checking-and-registering-your-client-with-hmrc\">MTD IT: Checking and Registering your Client with HMRC</a>.</span></span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:21;1928-1948\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>Related articles</strong></span></span></p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_u